// A prefab: a piece of a place, drawn as rows of glyphs, and what each glyph
// stands for; see `treasure_room.ron` for the full field list.
//
// Planks over a drop; lift the prize and the floor gives way to the floor
// below: 'P' is a `Mark`, read by `src/vaults.rs`'s own
// `spawn_rotten_floor_trigger`, which spawns the prize there and drops
// its taker through `vaults::fall_through_floor`.
(
    name: "The Rotten Floor",
    ground: "hall floor",
    rows: [
        "#######",
        "#.....#",
        "#..P..#",
        "#.....#",
        "###E###",
    ],
    legend: {
        '#': Tile("hall wall"),
        '.': Tile("hall floor"),
        'P': Mark,
        'E': Entry,
    },
)
